    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Docker Linux runtime**  ·  These panels measure the Linux system running Docker. On macOS with OrbStack or Docker Desktop, they describe the Linux VM and its namespaces, not the macOS kernel or total Mac resource use."
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "transparent": true,
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Runtime summary",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
